 	So, you want to know the story of the deamon blade Strombringer, 
with the power to steal men's souls. Stormbringer and its twin Mournblade, 
are powerful deamons in the form of swords. The two were claimed by the 
Elric of Melnibone, and his evil cousin, who's name escapes me, sworn
enemies. Elric used his blade make up for the fact the weakness caused by 
his albinism. In this respect Stormbringer served him well, but the black 
ruin carved sword had a nasty habbit of striking down friends as well as foes.
Elric and a friend wield both swords in the final battle against the forces of
Chaos, who were ignoring the cosmic ballance.After killing the gods of chaos
Elric ushered in a new age of Law, using the horn of Roland. Stormbringer 
then took his soul with the words,  "Fair well Elric of Menibone, I was 
infinately more evil than you." 
	This is a rough and short condesation of the Elric Series  by 
